// SOC-RULE-005: Windows Defender Real-Time Protection Disabled via PowerShell (generated from rules/sigma/win_defender_tamper.yml; review before use)
(event.code:1 OR event.code:4688) AND ((((process.executable:*\\powershell.exe OR process.executable:*\\pwsh.exe) AND (process.command_line:*Set\-MpPreference* OR process.command_line:*\-DisableRealtimeMonitoring* OR process.command_line:*\-DisableBehaviorMonitoring* OR process.command_line:*\-DisableIOAVProtection* OR process.command_line:*\-DisableScriptScanning*))))
